-- CENTRAL INTELLIGENCE KERNEL v0.1 — PROPOSAL ONLY
--
-- This file is deliberately located outside any active migration directory.
-- It has NOT been applied to Supabase, is not imported by Go code, and must
-- not be executed without a separate data-model, tenancy/RLS, privacy,
-- retention, backup, and rollout review.
--
-- Proposed storage is a separate ci_kernel schema to avoid mutating existing
-- Concierge compatibility tables. UUIDs are generated by the application so
-- this proposal does not assume any enabled Postgres extension.

-- BEGIN;
